#: app/templates/faq.html:5
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Nsɛmmisa a wɔbisa paa"

#: app/templates/faq.html:11
msgid "Is my data secure?"
msgstr "Me nsɛm ho yɛ den anaa?"

#: app/templates/faq.html:15
msgid ""
"Yes, absolutely. We use industry-standard encryption and security "
"protocols to ensure all your personal and health information is kept "
"confidential and secure."
msgstr ""
"Aane, ampa ara. Yɛde nsisi ne ahotoso nhyehyɛe a yɛde boa wɔn a wɔde nsɛm"
" to hɔ no si ho ban pa ara na yɛyɛ adwuma no."

#: app/templates/faq.html:21
msgid "What equipment do I need?"
msgstr "Dɛn na mehia de bɛyɛ adwuma no?"

#: app/templates/faq.html:25
msgid ""
"All you need is a device with an internet connection, a web browser, and "
"a working camera and microphone (like a smartphone, laptop, or tablet). "
"No special software is required."
msgstr ""
"Nneɛma a wopɛ nyinaa ne sɛ wo wɔ intanɛt, browser, kamera ne mikrofon a "
"ɛyɛ adwuma (te sɛ fon, laptop anaa tablet). Nsiesie foforɔ biara mmom nni"
" hia."

#: app/templates/faq.html:31
msgid "Can I get a prescription?"
msgstr "Mɛnya aduru atenka anaa?"

#: app/templates/faq.html:35
msgid ""
"Yes. If the doctor determines a prescription is medically necessary, they"
" can upload a secure digital copy for you to download from your dashboard"
" after the consultation."
msgstr ""
"Aane. Sɛ dɔkita no huu sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkyerɛw aduru bi ma wo a, ɔbɛtumi de yɛ "
"ama w’abɛtwe no fi w’ankasa krataa nkɔfa fiehyia no mu."

#: app/templates/health_library.html:4
msgid "Health Library"
msgstr "Apɔwmuden Nwoma Dɔkotow"

#: app/templates/health_library.html:12
msgid "No articles found in the library."
msgstr "Nwoma biara nni hɔ wɔ nwoma dɔkotow no mu."

#: app/templates/how_it_works.html:5 app/templates/landing.html:25
